<title>USA: Whittman-Hart to open new offices in Q4.</title>
<headline>Whittman-Hart to open new offices in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Whittman-Hart Inc said it plans to open new offices in the fourth quarter in Cleveland and Columbus, Ohio.</p>
<p>&quot;The demand for our services remains strong. We recently solidified several new deals...and surpassed a major milestone of 1,000 employees. We are actively pursuing strategic acquisition opportunities,&quot; said chief executive Robert Bernard.</p>
<p>Whittman-Hart designs, develops and implements integrated computer system projects.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
